<!-- ========== KPI DASHBOARD ========== -->
<div class="section" id="kpi">
  <h2>Executive KPI Dashboard</h2>
  <p>Key headline metrics drawn from the most recent year with robust coverage ({R['recent_year']}, {kpi['n_countries_recent']} countries reporting). These indicators provide a snapshot of the global state of intentional homicide.</p>
  <div class="kpi-dashboard">
